{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Db6SGziPdg1794378600.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>前立法會議員黃錦輝在中大校園內酒後駕駛，承認不小心駕駛等四項控罪。</p><p></p><p>黃錦輝在沙田裁判法院應訊。案情指，他涉嫌今年6月29日晚，在中大校園內酒後駕駛，撞到兩輛車後不顧而去，被控酒後駕駛、危險駕駛、發生交通意外後無停車，及發生交通意外後沒有報案四項控罪。</p><p></p><p>控方今日在庭上表示，將危險駕駛控罪改控不小心駕駛罪，黃錦輝承認四項控罪，希望法庭考慮判處社會服務令或緩刑，裁判官押後至本月26日判刑。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.504284+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T01:40:40.326738+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:10.070531+00:00","content_hash":"8ea22775719d35f9fe8ab53df0d4cd4c82ed9f683155451f2a847f3651c88bb4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.504284+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}